# ---- Build output ----------------------------------------------------------
# Rust build tree produced by `cargo` / `tauri build` (~4 GB). Never commit it.
src-tauri/target/
target/

# Stray compiler output at the repo root (`rustc file.rs` writes ./rust_out).
rust_out

# Node tooling (optional local CLI installs) and download caches.
node_modules/
*.tgz

# ---- Release staging -------------------------------------------------------
# Scratch space for a local release build: the renamed installers, checksums,
# the checksum comparison and the mount point used by install smoke tests. All
# of it is either reproducible or uploaded as a GitHub Release asset, never
# committed.
.release/
.release-tmp/
dist/
*.dmg
*.dmg.sha256
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
*.sha256

# ---- Local workbench data --------------------------------------------------
# The app's own working project: Canonical project.json, imported assets, and
# the rebuildable .workspace caches (index.json, snapshots, diagnostics) plus
# the runtime project.lock and project.json.bak auto-backup.
#
# This is local user data, not product source. Delete this rule if you *want*
# your working course project versioned alongside the code.
.workbench-project/

# The app's runtime state directory for whichever folder is opened as a
# workbench project — including the repo root itself. Holds the browser
# session, AI execution records and index caches: rebuildable local state,
# never product source, so it must not be committed (the repo is public).
.workspace/

# ---- OS / editor noise -----------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.Rhistory

# Per-editor agent state (statusline/hook wiring, editor-local rules).
.claude/
.cursor/

# ---- Local overrides -------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.local

# ---- Internal development-planning documents -------------------------------
# This repository publishes the PRODUCT only. Task cards, milestone plans,
# closure/acceptance reports, spec packages and other software-development
# planning material must never re-enter the tree — keep it outside the repo.
PROJECT_MASTER_CONTROL.md
TASK_CARD_*
V0-T*
V1-T*
V1_*
V1-*
AI_Course_Workbench_M1_*
AI_Course_Workbench_完整开发资料包*/
*.Closure.md
*.Closure_*.md
*_Closure_*.md
*_Completion_Report.md
*_Acceptance_Report.md
*Completion_Report.md
docs/reports/
docs/release-playbook.md
.superpowers/
AGENTS.md
.mcp.json

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed.
graft/
